sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as Training Operator<br/>(codeflare/kubeflow)
    participant Entrypoint as accelerate_launch.py<br/>(Container Entrypoint)
    participant Config as JSON Config<br/>(File or Env Var)
    participant Trainer as sft_trainer.py<br/>(SFTTrainer)
    participant HFHub as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant LocalFS as Local Filesystem
    participant GPU as GPU (CUDA/FSDP)
    participant Tracker as Experiment Tracker<br/>(Aim/MLflow/ClearML)
    participant TermLog as /dev/termination-log

    Note over Operator,TermLog: Flow 1: Model Fine-Tuning Execution

    Operator->>Entrypoint: Launch container<br/>(Kubernetes Job)

    Entrypoint->>Config: Read SFT_TRAINER_CONFIG_JSON_PATH<br/>or SFT_TRAINER_CONFIG_JSON_ENV_VAR
    Config-->>Entrypoint: Training configuration (JSON)

    Entrypoint->>Trainer: accelerate launch<br/>(constructs CLI args)

    Trainer->>HFHub: Download model & tokenizer<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS, HF Token (optional)
    HFHub-->>Trainer: Model weights & tokenizer files

    Trainer->>LocalFS: Load training dataset<br/>(File I/O)
    LocalFS-->>Trainer: Training data

    Note over Trainer: Apply PEFT config<br/>(LoRA/aLoRA/PromptTuning/Mxfp4)
    Note over Trainer: Load acceleration plugins<br/>(if configured)
    Note over Trainer: Initialize TrainerController<br/>(early stopping policies)

    loop Training Loop
        Trainer->>GPU: Forward/backward pass<br/>(CUDA/FSDP)
        GPU-->>Trainer: Gradients
        Trainer->>Tracker: Log metrics<br/>(loss, learning rate, etc.)
        Note over Trainer: TrainerController evaluates<br/>rules (e.g., loss threshold)
    end

    Trainer->>LocalFS: Save model checkpoint<br/>(output_dir)
    Trainer->>LocalFS: Write .complete sentinel

    alt Success
        Entrypoint-->>Operator: Exit code 0
    else User Error
        Entrypoint->>TermLog: Write error message
        Entrypoint-->>Operator: Exit code 1-127
    else Internal Error
        Entrypoint->>TermLog: Write error message
        Entrypoint-->>Operator: Exit code 203
    end

    Note over Operator,TermLog: Flow 2: Dataset Preparation (Utility)

    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS TLS

    Note over S3,LocalFS: pull_and_format_datasets.py
    Trainer->>S3: Download datasets<br/>HTTPS, TLS, AWS credentials (env vars)
    S3-->>Trainer: Raw dataset files
    Trainer->>LocalFS: Write formatted data
